                    {
                        "sense_id": "a640fc80-308b-3e6b-a493-1cc5899cf28e",
                        "entry_id": "c033b264-d4b0-3542-a31d-99dff5eb9f08",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Andersdenkende in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31e1b456-a22d-4246-837f-bd4f1a245bae",
                                "sense_id": "a640fc80-308b-3e6b-a493-1cc5899cf28e",
                                "text": "Sie ist eine Abweichlerin."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a40894db-df6e-439e-9fd1-c748e6343a17",
                        "source_entry_id": "c033b264-d4b0-3542-a31d-99dff5eb9f08",
                        "source_sense_id": "a640fc80-308b-3e6b-a493-1cc5899cf28e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Andersdenkende in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System",
                        "target_lang_word": "dissenter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dissenter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e3f4205-a718-3172-ae90-71ef6787147f",
                                        "entry_id": "717bd32b-0f0b-3777-bca3-f7ae825039ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who dissents (disagrees), especially from an established church."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de4987c6-4b1b-42dc-8497-6f67d421ce1b",
                                                "sense_id": "1e3f4205-a718-3172-ae90-71ef6787147f",
                                                "text": "As my study proceeded, I began to see that an investigation of organizational morality should also explore managerial dissenters, so-called whistleblowers, many of whom take stands against their organizations on grounds that they define as moral."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "16b0692e-fdf3-449b-bee7-f1755e896d4c",
                        "source_entry_id": "c033b264-d4b0-3542-a31d-99dff5eb9f08",
                        "source_sense_id": "a640fc80-308b-3e6b-a493-1cc5899cf28e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Andersdenkende in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System",
                        "target_lang_word": "deviationist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deviationist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                        "entry_id": "de3e8b6e-de80-3a72-8d7c-a0a875e8a1d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who deviates from accepted beliefs or policies, especially from a prescribed form of Communism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f7c7512-bccb-4bac-a38a-fdfdb9596176",
                                                "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                                "text": "The Hsicheng District CCP Committee in Peking Municipality has fully mobilized the masses and led all middle schools in the district to conduct mass debates on the revolution in education, dealing fierce counterblows to the absurd arguments aimed at stirring up the right deviationist wind to reverse previous verdicts in education."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d92b1d6-a487-4dd4-a9ff-f9b273e94874",
                                                "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                                "text": "Theirs was the confession, and Mr. Kang turned them out by the dozen throughout his life, expiating one supposed crime after another by denouncing himself as a reactionary element, a deviationist and whatever else was on the political menu that day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13d38b19-3e13-413a-a282-6b8c0dcba5ec",
                                                "sense_id": "b678e41d-8891-3344-a5fe-b6781f2d3bb6",
                                                "text": "For the Italian journalist Enzo Biagi, he recalled the ride in the \"black crow,\" the prison truck in which he was accompanied by other \"deviationists . . . terrorists, Trotskyites, ex-Social Democrats.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a86642d6-ea1d-4c4c-aab6-a5ae3ce32865",
                        "source_entry_id": "c033b264-d4b0-3542-a31d-99dff5eb9f08",
                        "source_sense_id": "a640fc80-308b-3e6b-a493-1cc5899cf28e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Andersdenkende in einem auf Linientreue ausgerichteten System",
                        "target_lang_word": "déviationniste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "déviationniste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "933d32a2-cd1a-3d5e-96ca-466d6cf7c200",
                                        "entry_id": "6008ab0f-93e1-3e5d-adbc-6f212cf096df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui dévie du droit chemin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44f4a097-9235-436f-8b5c-e558d55001e9",
                                                "sense_id": "933d32a2-cd1a-3d5e-96ca-466d6cf7c200",
                                                "text": "Pendant ce temps, le noyau dur du pouvoir s'enferme, lui, dans une lutte interne entre conservateurs « traditionalistes » et « déviationnistes », excluant définitivement les réformistes de toute forme de débat politique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "déviationniste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "584c263a-8ff8-3793-bba7-23cb2a302b2b",
                                        "entry_id": "5adaf6fd-d81f-30a3-bbbd-067f0b46bd23",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne faisant preuve de déviationnisme, c’est-à-dire ne suivant pas ou s’écartant de la ligne officielle de l’organisation à laquelle elle appartient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c18ffa0-1315-4fce-8c7e-e453886ba820",
                                                "sense_id": "584c263a-8ff8-3793-bba7-23cb2a302b2b",
                                                "text": "– Je vois… c’est un milieu de déviationnistes, ici… un groupe antiparti… Ayez donc le courage de l’avouer, Feliksa, vous regrettez le temps des bourgeois ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2fad15d-1a24-428f-9b5f-058af1144aab",
                                                "sense_id": "584c263a-8ff8-3793-bba7-23cb2a302b2b",
                                                "text": "Il est rare que le gouvernement veuille la mort d’un déviationniste."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6aa693ec-42e9-4aa4-a142-2187255d5fc4",
                        "source_entry_id": "c033b264-d4b0-3542-a31d-99dff5eb9f08",
